%% Phase2 / post / G-04 在线撤回消息
%% Helix owners: ws/handlers/posts_update.rs; ws/handlers/update_channel.rs; port_reply/message_v3_revoke.rs; channel/write/revoke.rs
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: revoke(postId)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_revoke", {postId})
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Mobile FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_revoke", {postId})
  else Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_revoke", {postId})
  end
  E->>IM: step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 actor/post/channel 权限并生成 corr_key
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST revoke request
  Host->>Go: HTTP revoke admission
  Go-->>Host: 2xx admission（不直接 Emit）
  Go-->>WS: WS posts_update(revoke,event_seq)
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(posts_update)
  E->>IM: dispatch revoke authority
  IM->>IM: event_seq duplicate/gap/order gate
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(message.revoke + cursor)
  Host->>DB: 原子写 message revoke、channel cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk/PersistErr)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  alt revoke commit succeeds
    IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(update_channel lastPost + member)
    Host->>DB: 去传输字段后写 channel/channel_member
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(channel PersistOk)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
    IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet channel_member/message
    Host->>DB: readback viewer-local absolute values
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:revoke(same post identity)
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:channel:update(lastPost)
    Sink-->>UI: Angular replaces message with recalled state
    Sink-->>FFI: batch raw post/channel events
    Sink-->>Web: EventBatch raw post/channel events
  else PersistErr / stale duplicate
    IM-->>Sink: no terminal event；duplicate event_seq is no-op
  end
  Note over UI,Web: 撤回不递增 unread；sender/receiver 从同一 durable authority 收敛，不由 UI 本地删除消息。
